    {
      "text": "Photo of an Xpert MTB/XDR cartridge beside a colour-coded table of possible result calls by drug class (N/A, isoniazid, fluoroquinolone, amikacin, kanamycin, capreomycin, ethionamide). Results such as 'Resistance DETECTED' and 'Low Resistance DETECTED' are shaded red, 'NOT DETECTED' green and 'INDETERMINATE' yellow.",
